{"id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-omega.md","title":"omega","display":"df-omega — omega","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-omega","aliases":["57-df-omega"],"display":"df-omega — omega","depends_on":["[[57-df-emptyset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega — omega"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc3ee5b04f0f3bd2\" href=\"?note=bc3ee5b04f0f3bd2\" title=\"57-df-emptyset\">57-df-emptyset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景为 ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 遍历集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ind}\\)</span> 为下述归纳集谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\mathbb N,\\omega\">\\(0,\\mathbb N,\\omega\\)</span> 和后继在本文件固定。自然数上的加法、乘法、指数采用相应自然数递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}(I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\emptyset\\in I\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;(x\\cup\\{x\\}\\in I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ind}(I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\emptyset\\in I\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;(x\\cup\\{x\\}\\in I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\quad n+1\\coloneqq n\\cup\\{n\\},\\quad\n\\omega\\coloneqq\\{n:\\forall I\\;(\\operatorname{Ind}(I)\\to n\\in I)\\},\\quad\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\quad n+1\\coloneqq n\\cup\\{n\\},\\quad\n\\omega\\coloneqq\\{n:\\forall I\\;(\\operatorname{Ind}(I)\\to n\\in I)\\},\\quad\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;m+0=m,\\quad m+(n+1)=(m+n)+1,\\\\\n&amp;m\\cdot0=0,\\quad m\\cdot(n+1)=m\\cdot n+m,\\\\\n&amp;m^0=1,\\quad m^{n+1}=m^n\\cdot m,\\quad\nm&lt;n\\leftrightarrow m\\in n,\\quad m\\le n\\leftrightarrow(m&lt;n\\lor m=n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;m+0=m,\\quad m+(n+1)=(m+n)+1,\\\\\n&amp;m\\cdot0=0,\\quad m\\cdot(n+1)=m\\cdot n+m,\\\\\n&amp;m^0=1,\\quad m^{n+1}=m^n\\cdot m,\\quad\nm&lt;n\\leftrightarrow m\\in n,\\quad m\\le n\\leftrightarrow(m&lt;n\\lor m=n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目按第 57 册原引用处所需接口在内部补齐；背景为 ZFC。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-emptyset","status":"resolved","id":"bc3ee5b04f0f3bd2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-emptyset]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ind}","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\mathbb N,\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ind}(I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\emptyset\\in I\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;(x\\cup\\{x\\}\\in I).","display":true},{"tex":"0\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\quad n+1\\coloneqq n\\cup\\{n\\},\\quad\n\\omega\\coloneqq\\{n:\\forall I\\;(\\operatorname{Ind}(I)\\to n\\in I)\\},\\quad\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&m+0=m,\\quad m+(n+1)=(m+n)+1,\\\\\n&m\\cdot0=0,\\quad m\\cdot(n+1)=m\\cdot n+m,\\\\\n&m^0=1,\\quad m^{n+1}=m^n\\cdot m,\\quad\nm<n\\leftrightarrow m\\in n,\\quad m\\le n\\leftrightarrow(m<n\\lor m=n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1026,"backlinks":[{"id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本文件使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的一元数值层级及 $\\chi_A$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 是 [[57-df-recursive-function]] 的部分递归函数谓词；$A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}$ 是下述本地集合类重载，不把函数和自然数集混为一类。"},{"id":"d6a5ff61521a8f18","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$、$r\\geq1$、$k\\in\\mathbb N$；关系 $A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r$ 以其特征函数 $\\chi_A$ 表示。$\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]；$\\chi_A$ 本身是总函数，因此这里表达可判定性。自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。本文件的层级作用于**数值关系**，不与另一个文件的原始语法公式集合混同；$\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0$ 是一元实例的原接口，额外下标 r 仅用于明示投影元数。"},{"id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"背景为 ZFC；$\\alpha,\\beta,\\kappa$ 为集合，$X,Y$ 为任意集合。$\\mathrm{Ord}$、$\\mathrm{Card}$、等势及基数在下式定义；$\\omega$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]。$\\in|_\\alpha$ 表示 $\\alpha$ 上的成员关系。"},{"id":"40a9587a80026ff4","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,k,m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\vec a\\in A^m$、$\\vec b\\in B^m$ 是等长有限列，$p_{\\vec a,\\vec b}=\\{\\langle a_j,b_j\\rangle:0\\leq j<m\\}$。自然数、空列与有序对见 [[57-df-omega]]、[[57-df-emptyset]]、[[57-df-ordered-pair]]。"},{"id":"b060448f50c005a8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 为集合；$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]；$f$ 是集合函数，见 [[57-df-set-function]]。"},{"id":"e985db086a1eebfb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V$ 为集合，$E\\subseteq V\\times V$，$G=\\langle V,E\\rangle$；集合见 [[57-df-set]]。$k\\in\\mathbb N$，见 [[57-df-omega]]；$\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}=\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:1\\le j\\le k\\}$，所以 $k=0$ 时颜色集为空。不额外要求边关系对称或无自环。"},{"id":"ccb159b85de6c3b6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"当前符号语法有固定有效编码，并固定一个单射 $c:\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$ 作为选择顺序；$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]。该参数一经固定不随输入选择，不从多个最一般合一子中临时选值。"},{"id":"f60efdcc5c3b9010","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为固定的一阶字母表；$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ 是同一 $S$ 上的结构，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，见 [[57-df-omega]]；$\\mathrm{qr}$ 取 [[57-df-quantifier-rank]]。不带赋值的 $\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi$ 按 [[57-df-satisfaction]] 对全部赋值取真值，仍比较全部开公式，不改成只比较句子。"},{"id":"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N=\\omega$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]；$n$ 为候选集合。"},{"id":"afc42c965ba86683","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 及其后继符号 $\\mathrm S$ 见 [[57-df-S-ar]]；$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]，项构造子见 [[57-df-term]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\underline{\\phantom n}$ 是以下自然数递归确定的函数，不是预先给定的数码族。"},{"id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f977c52fadb9a6ca","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}$ 保留非逻辑符号集 $\\{0,S,+,<\\}$：$0$ 为常量、$S$ 为一元函数、$+$ 为二元函数、$<$ 为二元关系。其完整字母表再并入固定变量与逻辑符号，$\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}$ 均取此完成字母表的视图。$\\mathbb N$ 为 [[57-df-omega]] 的自然数集；$\\mathfrak N$ 在本文件局部指下式的标准 Presburger 结构，而非任意载体为自然数的结构。"},{"id":"9f2c37860ff19d3b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Sigma_1^0$ 使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的**数值集合类**。$W_e$、$\\varphi_e$ 是 [[57-df-W-e]]、[[57-df-phi-e]] 的同一程序编号；自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。"},{"id":"4744f89052b0cbdb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N$ 是 [[57-df-omega]] 的自然数集合；自然数加法和乘法是背景集合论中的通常递归运算。$\\mathfrak N$ 是下式明确构造的标准结构。"},{"id":"bca56618509beeda","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A \\subseteq \\omega$ (自然数子集, see [[57-df-omega]])"},{"id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$v:\\mathbb N\\hookrightarrow V$ 是固定单射，$v_n=v(n)$，$\\mathrm{Var}=v[\\mathbb N]$；$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]。这里 $V$ 是一个给定集合；不把集合全域作为集合函数的余域。"},{"id":"b1118344012e3e87","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"43ca2d9b7fc5df00","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9eea9702761a060","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-ax-substitution-schema]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-finite-subset]]\n[[57-df-finite]]\n[[57-df-function-restriction]]\n[[57-df-function-symbol]]\n[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]\n[[57-df-indexed-product]]\n[[57-df-infinite]]\n[[57-df-injective]]\n[[57-df-mgu]]\n[[57-df-natural-number]]\n[[57-df-omega]]\n[[57-df-ordered-pair]]\n[[57-df-partial-function]]\n[[57-df-pow-fin]]\n[[57-df-range]]\n[[57-df-relation-domain]]\n[[57-df-relation-symbol]]\n[[57-df-relation]]\n[[57-df-sequent-rule]]\n[[57-df-set-function]]\n[[57-df-set]]\n[[57-df-total-order]]\n[[57-df-ultrafilter-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-universal-closure]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic